---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = "Disclaimer | CC3PO Docs";
const description = "Disclaimer for CC3PO documentation and knowledge base.";
---

<Layout title={title}>
  <div class="legal-page">
    <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
    <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: April 28, 2026</p>
    
    <div class="legal-content">
      <div class="warning-box">
        <strong>IMPORTANT: PLEASE READ THIS DISCLAIMER CAREFULLY</strong>
        <p>The documentation and guidance provided by CC3PO LLC is for informational purposes only. By using this documentation, you acknowledge and agree to the following disclaimers.</p>
      </div>
      
      <section>
        <h2>1. AI-Generated Content Advisory</h2>
        <p>CC3PO uses AI agents and machine learning to generate documentation, recommendations, and automated support. AI-generated content:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Is provided for <strong>advisory purposes only</strong> and not guaranteed to be accurate or complete</li>
          <li>May contain errors, hallucinations, or outdated information</li>
          <li>Should be verified by qualified human professionals before implementation</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>2. No Professional Advice</h2>
        <p>This documentation does not constitute:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Legal advice</li>
          <li>Financial advice</li>
          <li>Medical advice</li>
          <li>Professional certification</li>
        </ul>
        <p>For professional matters, consult qualified professionals in those fields.</p>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>3. Technical Guidance Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>Technical guides and tutorials are provided for educational purposes. Results may vary based on:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your specific environment and configuration</li>
          <li>Version differences in software or tools</li>
          <li>Third-party dependencies and integrations</li>
          <li>Your level of technical expertise</li>
        </ul>
        <p><strong>Always back up your data before implementing technical changes.</strong></p>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>4. Website Audit Results</h2>
        <p>Our audit tools and scanners provide <strong>recommendations only</strong> — not guarantees of improvement. Automated analysis may not identify all issues and should be reviewed by qualified professionals.</p>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>5. HIPAA Compliance Disclaimer</h2>
        <div class="hipaa-box">
          <strong>Healthcare Clients:</strong> HIPAA compliance guidance is informational only. We do not provide legal advice. Compliance depends on your implementation. Always consult a qualified HIPAA compliance professional.
        </div>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>6. Third-Party References</h2>
        <p>Documentation may reference third-party tools, services, or websites. We are not responsible for:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Availability or reliability of third-party services</li>
          <li>Changes to third-party APIs or functionality</li>
          <li>Third-party privacy practices or policies</li>
          <li>Damages from using third-party services</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>7. Code Examples</h2>
        <p>Code examples are provided "as is" without warranty. You are responsible for testing code in your own environment, modifying it for your needs, and ensuring security and compliance.</p>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>8. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p><strong>TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW:</strong> CC3PO LLC shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from your use of this documentation or Services.</p>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>9. Indemnification</h2>
        <p>You agree to indemnify and hold harmless CC3PO LLC from claims arising from your use of the documentation or implementation of technical guidance.</p>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>10. Changes to This Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>We may update this Disclaimer from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last Updated" date.</p>
      </section>
      
      <section>
        <h2>11. Contact Information</h2>
        <p>For questions about this Disclaimer:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Email: <a href="mailto:legal@cc3po.com">legal@cc3po.com</a></li>
          <li>Website: <a href="https://cc3po.com">cc3po.com</a></li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </div>
    
    <div class="back-link">
      <a href="/">← Back to Knowledge Base</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 40px 24px;
  }
  
  h1 {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  
  .last-updated {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  
  h2 {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: 20px;
    margin-top: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  
  p, li {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  
  ul {
    margin-left: 24px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  
  li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  
  a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  
  a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  
  .warning-box {
    background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.08);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--warning);
    padding: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }
  
  .warning-box strong {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: var(--warning);
  }
  
  .warning-box p {
    margin: 0;
  }
  
  .hipaa-box {
    background: rgba(233, 69, 96, 0.08);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
    padding: 16px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  
  .back-link {
    margin-top: 48px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
</style>
